Also I/O caching.

Saving an object when it's written to IndexedDB, localStorage, API, etc. and when the getter is invoked return a copy.

```js
let cache;

export function saveSettings(settings) {
  ...
  cache = settings;
}

export function fetchSettings() {
  if (cache) {
    const copy = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(cache));
    return Promise.resolve(copy);
  }
  ...
}
```

Could we use this to polyfill the proposed `ArrayBuffer.transfer()` method from [tc39/proposal-resizablearraybuffer](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-resizablearraybuffer) (previously [domenic/proposal-arraybuffer-transfer](https://github.com/domenic/proposal-arraybuffer-transfer))? 👀 

```javascript
function transferArrayBuffer(buffer) {
  return structuredClone(buffer, [buffer]);
}
```
